# Replay dataset (JSONL) — one record per line. Lines starting with '#' and
# blank lines are ignored.
#
# Domain-neutral replay samples for the general profile: the (query, answer,
# contexts) are taken as-is so the whole eval runs offline with no agent
# pipeline and no network.
#
# Required fields:
#   id        : stable record id (used in the report)
#   query     : the user question
#   answer    : the generated answer to score
# Optional fields:
#   contexts          : list of retrieved context strings (default: [])
#   reference_answer  : golden answer (enables context_recall; recommended)
#   intent            : detected intent (rule-based intent_accuracy; default: "")
#   source_count      : number of sources (rule-based source check; default: len(contexts))
#   tags              : free-form tags
#
# Contexts may be strings or {"content": "...", "source": "..."} dicts.
{"id":"replay_01","query":"Python 的 GIL 是什么？它对多线程有什么影响？","answer":"GIL 是 CPython 的全局解释器锁，保证同一时刻只有一个线程执行字节码。CPU 密集型任务无法真正并行，I/O 密集型任务因阻塞时释放 GIL 仍能受益。","contexts":["GIL（全局解释器锁）是 CPython 中的一把互斥锁，同一时刻只允许一个线程执行 Python 字节码。","在 I/O 密集型任务中，线程会在 I/O 阻塞时释放 GIL，因此多线程仍能提升吞吐。"],"reference_answer":"GIL（全局解释器锁）是 CPython 解释器中的一把互斥锁，它保证同一时刻只有一个线程执行 Python 字节码。因此多线程在 CPU 密集型任务上无法真正并行；I/O 密集型任务则因线程会在 I/O 阻塞时释放 GIL 而仍能受益于多线程。","intent":"rag_query","tags":["python","concurrency","replay"]}
{"id":"replay_02","query":"如何对一台 Linux 服务器进行定期备份？","answer":"直接把整盘复制一份就行了。","contexts":["定期备份应明确范围与保留策略，常用工具包括 rsync 与 tar，并结合 cron 定时执行。"],"reference_answer":"1) 确定备份范围与策略（全量/增量、保留周期）；2) 选择工具如 rsync 或 tar；3) 编写脚本并结合 cron 定时执行；4) 将备份副本传输到异地或对象存储；5) 定期演练恢复以验证备份可用。","intent":"rag_query","tags":["ops","backup","replay"]}
